Showcase — provenance and authorship
====================================

This repository (eric-vergo/Showcase) is a FORK. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or maintained by the upstream Lean FRO project. It is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see the LICENSE file).

Two layers of authorship are present, and each source file's copyright header
reflects which layer that file belongs to.

Upstream layer
--------------
This fork derives from leanprover/verso-blueprint (the Verso "blueprint" genre),
part of the Verso authoring toolchain by Lean FRO, LLC and its contributors,
including Emilio J. Gallego Arias and David Thrane Christiansen. Files with
genuine upstream lineage keep their original "Copyright (c) ... Lean FRO LLC"
notice and their original author(s). Where the fork modified such a file, the
fork's contributors are appended to its Authors line and the prior authors are
preserved verbatim — we do not remove a real prior author of code we build on.

The upstream baseline is Verso / verso-blueprint v4.32.0, commit
51ebcae4b3133f407807e581178d2dcc705ac683.

Fork layer
----------
The fork work in this repository is by Eric Vergo, with AI assistance from
Anthropic's Claude models under Eric's direction. Per the git commit trailers —
