    Claude Fable 5, Claude Opus 4.8, Claude Opus 5

Files created in this fork with no upstream counterpart ("fork-original" files)
carry a "Copyright (c) 2026 Eric Vergo" notice and list Eric Vergo together with
the Claude models above as Authors.

How lineage is determined
-------------------------
Lineage is decided by git history, not by guesswork. A .lean file present in the
upstream baseline above is upstream-lineage; a .lean file first added on this
fork (git diff --diff-filter=A / --find-renames against the baseline) with no
upstream counterpart is fork-original. The script

    scripts/check-header-provenance.sh

enforces that fork-original .lean files do not silently reacquire the upstream
copyright-header template — the class of defect recorded in the project's audit
as finding CX-004.

Vendored third-party assets (d3, d3-graphviz, marked, KaTeX, and others under
src/VersoBlueprint/**/vendor/) retain their own upstream licenses; see
src/VersoBlueprint/vendor/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
